{
 "duration": 47.381,
 "exact_word_timing": true,
 "lines": [
  {
   "beat": 0,
   "text": "A sailor's old scar splits open, years after it healed.",
   "start": 0.05,
   "end": 2.695
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "It's 1747, aboard HMS Salisbury.",
   "start": 2.895,
   "end": 5.602
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "His gums are bleeding. His teeth are loose.",
   "start": 5.682,
   "end": 7.857
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "And he's not the only one. The ship's surgeon says this disease kills more British sailors than enemy guns.",
   "start": 7.937,
   "end": 12.587
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "So the surgeon, James Lind, picks twelve sick men and splits them into six pairs.",
   "start": 12.787,
   "end": 16.525
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "Each pair gets a different cure. Cider. Vinegar. Seawater.",
   "start": 16.605,
   "end": 19.384
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "And one pair gets two oranges and a lemon, every day.",
   "start": 19.464,
   "end": 22.088
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "Fruit? Against the deadliest killer at sea?",
   "start": 22.288,
   "end": 24.165
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "Six days later, the fruit runs out.",
   "start": 24.245,
   "end": 25.888
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "But one of those two men is already back on duty.",
   "start": 25.968,
   "end": 28.251
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "You see, think of the last time you cut yourself.",
   "start": 28.451,
   "end": 30.731
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "Your body sewed it shut with collagen, tiny ropes that hold your skin together.",
   "start": 30.811,
   "end": 34.379
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "And to tie those ropes, your body needs vitamin C. It can't make its own.",
   "start": 34.459,
   "end": 38.091
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "Months at sea with no fresh food, and the knots start slipping. Even the old ones.",
   "start": 38.171,
   "end": 41.87
  },
  {
   "beat": 5,
   "text": "Two oranges and a lemon did what medicine couldn't.",
   "start": 42.07,
   "end": 44.438
  },
  {
   "beat": 5,
   "text": "And the navy took forty-eight years to listen.",
   "start": 44.518,
   "end": 46.481
  }
 ],
